do a full code review of this project and put the result in the docs folder.
Look for best practices, proper tests of all functionality, adherence to the guardrails in ../Dev-standards,
proper handling of exceptions, resource leaks, dead code, and overall efficiency issues.
Also look for duplicated code that could be placed into shared methods.
Look for patterns that are 'cutting corners' which are ok for personal use but could fail in a commercial deployment
Keep an eye out for inefficiencies that would have an impact in production
